{"thread":{"threadID":4935,"boardID":121,"topic":"Admin-Meeting","time":1510006943,"userID":2703,"username":"My Name is Jeff","lastPostTime":1510050070,"lastPoster":"wickedy","replies":11,"views":119,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":3},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":73635,"threadID":4935,"userID":2703,"username":"My Name is Jeff","subject":"Admin-Meeting","time":1510006943,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1510006975,"value":1},{"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","time":1510007528,"value":1},{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1510008038,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Heyho,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>caused by some incidents  at the moment, I hope we&#x27;re going to have a admin-meeting as soon as possible. There are a lot of things to talk about, we are losing a lot of admins and that could be a big trouble.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>greatings<br>Jeff</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":73637,"threadID":4935,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1510007525,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2703,"username":"My Name is Jeff","time":1510007583,"value":1},{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1510007647,"value":1},{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1510008034,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hello,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>yes, it would make sense to have an admin meeting now. I would suggest tomorrow (07. November) at 8PM CET.<br>If that time is not suitable for some, please leave a message so that we can potentially reschedule the meeting.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Thanks.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":73638,"threadID":4935,"userID":2,"username":"Sky","subject":"","time":1510007597,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1510007713,"value":1},{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1510007952,"value":1},{"userID":2611,"username":"FantasyGamer29","time":1510035150,"value":1},{"userID":1173,"username":"Nightlight","time":1510009052,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Nochmal in deutsch:<br>wegen der aktuellen Thematik macht es durchaus Sinn ein Admin-Meeting zeitnah in die Wege zu leiten.<br>Morgen den 07.11.2017 um 20:00 wäre der Termin für genanntes Meeting.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Bitte versucht anwesend zu sein.<br>Aktuell sind einige wichtige Punkte zu bereden und auch Ihr seid gefragt.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1253-blackfire/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@BlackFire</a> <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1954-wickedy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@wickedy</a> <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1657-viruszz/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@ViruszZ</a> <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2101-hypnoxas/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Hypnoxas</a> <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1599-abendstille/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Abendstille</a> <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2404-mas0n/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Mas0n</a> <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2229-what/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@WHAT</a> <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2369-luckiris/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Luckiris</a> <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1812-mike/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Mike</a> <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1749-cybertronix/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@CyberTroniX</a> <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2335-thorin-pikachu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Thorin Pikachu</a> <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/8-laduck/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@laduck</a> <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2648-winnie/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Winnie</a> <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2378-verdia/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Verdia</a> <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2703-my-name-is-jeff/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@My Name is Jeff</a> <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2511-xlaer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Xlaer</a> <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2611-fantasygamer29/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@FantasyGamer29</a> <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2716-menoc/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Menoc</a> <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1173-nightlight/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Nightlight</a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>- Sky &amp; Nachtfrische</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":73639,"threadID":4935,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1510007613,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1510007716,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p><span class=\"archive-emoji\">😏</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":73640,"threadID":4935,"userID":1599,"username":"Abendstille","subject":"","time":1510007971,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p><a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1-sky/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Sky</a> <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1825-nachtfrische/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Nachtfrische</a> Komme wohl 10-15 min später da ich erst um 20 uhr heimkomme!</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":73641,"threadID":4935,"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","subject":"","time":1510008385,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>I will try my best to free my time and be there tomorrow.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":73644,"threadID":4935,"userID":1173,"username":"Nightlight","subject":"","time":1510009085,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>¯\\_ツ_/¯<strong></strong></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":73646,"threadID":4935,"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","subject":"","time":1510009508,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Kein Bock.<br> <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😏</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":73648,"threadID":4935,"userID":2611,"username":"FantasyGamer29","subject":"","time":1510032969,"lastEditTime":1510053547,"editCount":1,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":1812,"editor":"Mike","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Naja die Idee ist sehr sinnvoll allerdings werde ich wahrscheinlich nicht können daher es für mich zu spät ist je nachdem wie lange es geht.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Edit: Ich könnte maximal bis um 21 Uhr</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>PS:anscheinend kann man seine Post auf dem Handy nich editieren.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":73650,"threadID":4935,"userID":2511,"username":"Xlaer","subject":"","time":1510042235,"lastEditTime":1510053577,"editCount":1,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":1812,"editor":"Mike","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Muss schauen würde erst so um 20:45 kommen, bin relativ spät zu Hause.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<details><summary>Spoiler</summary><p><a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2611-fantasygamer29/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@FantasyGamer29</a> Les die Forumregeln <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😏</span></p></details><p><br></p>\n<p>Von mir auch ein Doppelpost wegen Edit Problems auf Handy</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Habe Spätdienst also fällt es heute für mich aus</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Forumpost was besprochen wurde wäre dann sinnvoll</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":73652,"threadID":4935,"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","subject":"","time":1510046257,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Sorry but I can&#x27;t be there, my job ends 21:05 and at home I will be 21:45. But it is not like I would have something to say anyway.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":73653,"threadID":4935,"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","subject":"","time":1510050070,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1510068036,"value":1},{"userID":1173,"username":"Nightlight","time":1510081287,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>FantasyGamer29</strong></cite><p>Edit: Ich könnte maximal bis um 21 Uhr</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>PS:anscheinend kann man seine Post auf dem Handy nich editieren.<br></p></blockquote><blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>Xlaer</strong></cite><p>Von mir auch ein Doppelpost wegen Edit Problems auf Handy</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Habe Spätdienst also fällt es heute für mich aus</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Forumpost was besprochen wurde wäre dann sinnvoll<br></p></blockquote><p>Man kann im Admintopic nur als Forenmod oder Head-Admin und höher Posts bearbeiten.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ich weiß nicht ob ich es zeitlich schaffe, da das ganze doch sehr kurzfristig ist.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Des Weiteren würde ich ohnehin nicht viel zu sagen haben da mir über die Entscheidungen und die Situationen selbst leider der nötige Einblick fehlt.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Sobald ich Zeit finde werde ich mich diesbezüglich mit <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1-sky/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Sky</a> außeinandersetzen,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>ich hoffe ihr könnt das nachvollziehen und mein eventuelles &quot;Fehlen&quot; entschuldigen.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Beste Grüße,<br>wickedy</p>","polls":[]}]}